on_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Sequence premium analyses (details in scripts, not read).\n- observed_verdict: abandoned\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear\n- auto_confidence: medium (0.65)\n- auto_addresses_question: RQC:RQC-019"}, {"id": "FAM:SF40", "score": 0.178, "document": "# FAM:SF40 | Study family SF40: Player and teammate sequential premiums\n- observed_research_question: Player and teammate sequential premiums\n- auto_outcome_status: not a hypothesis test\n- observed_hypothesis: Specific same-player and teammate X->Y sequences carry PPP premiums above Y's baseline.\n- observed_result: [APPA-053] Top same-player: P. George DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.560 n=31 t=+2.2; J. Brown +0.349 n=62; L. Doncic DRIVE->PNR +0.309 n=53. Top teammate: K. Towns->O. Anunoby DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.398 n=30; J. Brown->J. Tatum DRIVE->PN [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- observed_result: [APPS-038] Top: P. George DRIVE->SPOT_UP +0.560 (n=31, t=+2.2). D. Mitchell SPOT_UP->DRIVE +0.279 (n=56, t=+2.8). Bottom: C. White DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.466 (n=37); D. Bane DRIVE->PNR -0.324 (n=70, t=-2.7). Most cells DIRECT [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:label_or_classification_error\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample"}, {"id": "FAM:SF30", "score": 0.117, "document": "# FAM:SF30 | Study family SF30: Brown to Tatum matched causal sequence test\n- observed_research_question: Brown to Tatum matched causal sequence test\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Jaylen Brown involvement raises PPP on Tatum's next BOS possession beyond matched state/opponent controls.\n- observed_result: Def A ATT -0.017, bootstrap CI [-0.092, +0.061], perm p=0.028. Def B ATT -0.077, CI [-0.146, -0.001]. Placebo mean ~0; real ATT inside placebo 95% range both defs. Signs flip across quarters/RS-PO.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:PLACEBO_DEPENDENCE\n- observed_failure_evidence: ATT not positive; does not separate from shuffled-Brown placebo; wrong-signed where 'significant'.\n- observed_sample_and_power: treated 1,173 (A) / 1,313 (B)\n- observed_method: PSM 1:3 caliper 0.05; Def A initiator (1173 treated / 5819 control); Def B event involvement; shuffled-Brown placebo.\n- observed_verdict: null"}], "n_results": 4}

